<section class="page-lead page-shell" aria-labelledby="work-title">
  <p class="eyebrow">ForgeWire Labs · Our work</p>
  <h1 id="work-title">Different problems. <em>Engineering that holds together.</em></h1>
  <p class="lead-copy">We didn't set out to build a list of unrelated apps. We kept running into problems that existing boundaries didn't solve for us: context lost between sessions, authority buried in tool configurations, work spread across machines, and decisions that disappeared when a task was marked done. Some of those problems became infrastructure. Others became independent products. We keep the responsibilities separate so each system remains useful on its own.</p>
</section>

